{"seq":1,"slug":"columnar-memory-layout-encoding","title":"列式内存布局、编码与空值位图：向量化执行的物理基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/memory-pipeline-vector/columnar-memory-layout-encoding","wordCount":2631,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"列式内存布局-编码与空值位图-向量化执行的物理基础\">列式内存布局、编码与空值位图：向量化执行的物理基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-列是缓冲区数组-而不是记录数组\">核心概念：列是缓冲区数组，而不是记录数组</h2><p>向量化算子能跑满内存带宽的前提，是数据在内存中的摆放方式与算子的访问模式一致。行存（row-oriented / NSM）把一行的全部字段连续排列，<code>SELECT</code> 只用到 40 列中的 3 列时，缓存行仍会把整行拉进来，有效带宽浪费超过 90%。列存（column-oriented / DSM）把同一列的取值连续排列，一次扫描只触碰被引用的列。设表有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 列、查询引用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 列、行长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 字节、行数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，两种布局必须搬入 cache 的字节数之比为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mi>C</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{B_{row}}{B_{col}} = \\frac{N \\cdot W \\cdot b}{N \\cdot C \\cdot b} = \\frac{W}{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>跨境电商订单宽表动辄 40–80 列，而 <code>SELECT country, sum(amount) FROM orders WHERE created_at &gt;= ...</code> 只引 3 列，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W/C \\approx 15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span>。该结论由 Stonebraker 等人在 <em>C-Store: A Column-oriented DBMS</em>（VLDB 2005）形式化，MonetDB/X100（Boncz, Zukowski, Nes, CIDR 2005）进一步证明列存加上向量化批处理能再拉开一个数量级的差距——列存是向量化的<strong>前提</strong>，不是它的替代品。代价是单行点查要分摊 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 个缓冲区的 I/O、行重建需重拼散落的列，故写入路径普遍做成按行缓冲后批量转列（delta store + compaction，见 DuckDB storage 文档 <code>https://duckdb.org/docs/stable/internals/storage</code>）。</p>\n<p>描述列式内存的事实标准是 Apache Arrow Columnar Format（<code>https://arrow.apache.org/docs/format/Columnar.html</code>）：它把一列抽象成<strong>若干等长或近等长的缓冲区（buffer）</strong>，而非一串结构体。一个 <code>Array</code> 由 <code>length</code>、<code>null_count</code>、可选的 validity buffer，加上类型专属的 data / offset buffer 组成。这种抽象是零拷贝（zero-copy）的基础——父子数组可共享内存，切片只改偏移量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Array: Int32&lt;br/&gt;length=5, null_count=1&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Validity buffer&lt;br/&gt;1 bit/element, LSB-first&lt;br/&gt;1=valid, 0=null&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Data buffer&lt;br/&gt;4 bytes x 5&lt;br/&gt;定长无填充&quot;]&#10;    D[&quot;Array: Utf8&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;Validity buffer&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;Offsets buffer&lt;br/&gt;int32 x (n+1), 前缀和&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;Data buffer&lt;br/&gt;变长字节池&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Array: Int32&lt;br/&gt;length=5, null_count=1\"] --&gt; B[\"Validity buffer&lt;br/&gt;1 bit/element, LSB-first&lt;br/&gt;1=valid, 0=null\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Data buffer&lt;br/&gt;4 bytes x 5&lt;br/&gt;定长无填充\"]\n    D[\"Array: Utf8\"] --&gt; E[\"Validity buffer\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"Offsets buffer&lt;br/&gt;int32 x (n+1), 前缀和\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"Data buffer&lt;br/&gt;变长字节池\"]</pre><p>图中关键的不变量是：<strong>同一类型的所有元素共享同一份布局描述</strong>，算子只需处理「定长」与「变长 + 偏移量」两种形态，而非每种类型一套逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定长与变长-偏移量缓冲区与视图结构\">定长与变长：偏移量缓冲区与视图结构</h2><p>定长类型（<code>int8/16/32/64</code>、<code>float</code>/<code>double</code>、<code>date</code>、<code>timestamp</code>、定长十进制）的 data buffer 就是 <code>n * sizeof(T)</code> 字节的紧排数组，元素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的地址是 <code>base + i * sizeof(T)</code>。这个「地址可算」的性质是 SIMD 加载的前提——<code>_mm256_loadu_si256(base + i * 4)</code> 一步到位，无需遍历指针。</p>\n<p>变长类型（<code>VARCHAR</code>、<code>BLOB</code>）无法紧排，Arrow 用 <strong>offsets + data</strong> 两段式：offsets 是长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的 <code>int32</code>（或 <code>int64</code>）前缀和数组，元素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的字节范围是 <code>[offsets[i], offsets[i+1])</code>，落在共享 data buffer 里。「取第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个字符串」于是变成两次整型读加一次切片，而不是解引用指针——列存里没有逐元素指针，这是它与「数组 of <code>char*</code>」的本质差别；Parquet 的 <code>BYTE_ARRAY</code> 采用同一思路。</p>\n<p>两段式仍有短串痛点：每次比较要先读 offsets 再跳进 data buffer。Arrow 从 1.0 起为 <code>Utf8</code>/<code>Binary</code> 引入 <strong>view 布局</strong>（<code>Utf8View</code>，俗称 StringView）：每个元素是 16 字节定长结构，前 4 字节为长度，后 12 字节按长度分两种情况——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 字节时直接<strong>内联</strong>存放，超过则放 4 字节前缀 + 4 字节 buffer 索引 + 4 字节偏移量。国家码 <code>US</code>/<code>DE</code>、币种 <code>USD</code>/<code>EUR</code>、物流状态码等短串因此完全不触碰第二块内存，前缀不等也能在 4 字节内判定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>布局</th>\n<th>元素寻址成本</th>\n<th>适合的数据</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定长紧排 data buffer</td>\n<td>一次乘法寻址</td>\n<td>数值、时间、定长十进制</td>\n<td>无法表达变长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>offsets + data 两段式</td>\n<td>两次整型读 + 切片</td>\n<td>通用变长字符串</td>\n<td>短串也要跳转一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>View（StringView）</td>\n<td>定长 16B 直读，短串零跳转</td>\n<td>短串占比较高的维度列</td>\n<td>内存放大，且仅部分类型有实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"空值位图-三值逻辑的物理载体\">空值位图：三值逻辑的物理载体</h2><p>SQL 的 NULL 不是某个「魔法值」，而是一个独立的位平面。Arrow 与 Parquet 都用 <strong>validity bitmap</strong>：每元素 1 位，位序 LSB-first（第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 位在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor i/8 \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 字节的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\bmod 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 位），1 表示非空、0 表示空。空间开销为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>overhead</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> bit</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>sizeof</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> bit</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>sizeof</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{overhead} = \\frac{1 \\text{ bit}}{8 \\cdot \\text{sizeof}(T) \\text{ bit}} = \\frac{1}{8 \\cdot \\text{sizeof}(T)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">overhead</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> bit</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> bit</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对 <code>int32</code> 是 3.125%，对 <code>int8</code> 是 12.5%——窄列上位图开销不可忽略，这也是 Parquet 对可空窄列倾向用定义级别（definition level）而非独立位图的原因。位图的优势在于它是<strong>硬件友好的并行载体</strong>：判定「两列同一行都非空」只需两个 64 位字按位 <code>AND</code>，「任一列为空」只需 <code>OR</code> 后取反；DuckDB 的 <code>ValidityMask</code> 与 Velox 的位图包装（<code>https://facebookincubator.github.io/velox/develop/vectors.html</code>）都把「按 64 位字批量处理」作为默认路径。把 NULL 折叠成 <code>INT32_MIN</code> 之类的哨兵值虽省掉位图，却会污染聚合与谓词——<code>sum</code> 会算进哨兵、<code>count</code> 无法区分空与零值，故现代引擎一律拒绝。</p>\n<p>真正让工程出错的是位图与谓词、选择向量的交互顺序。SQL 是三值逻辑：<code>NULL = &#39;EU&#39;</code> 求值为 <code>NULL</code> 而非 <code>false</code>。过滤运算符不能把位图直接当布尔掩码，正确顺序是<strong>先算谓词掩码，再与 validity 做 AND，按三值语义落到选择向量上</strong>（见 <a href=\"../column-operators-simd/simd-selection-vector-model\">./1_simd-selection-vector-model.md</a> 中「NULL 与选择正交」一节）。<code>NOT</code> 最易翻车：对 <code>NOT (region &lt;&gt; &#39;EU&#39;)</code>，NULL 行必须保持 NULL 从而在 <code>WHERE</code> 中被滤掉；若先把 NULL 压成 <code>false</code> 再取反，NULL 行会被错误保留。另一条易被忽视的契约是<strong>空值的两种合法表示</strong>：<code>Array</code> 可以不带 validity buffer 而 <code>null_count = 0</code>（无空值列的快速路径），也可携带全 1 的位图——把「无空值」当成显式的类型状态或标志位，让快路径与慢路径都是显式分支。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编码谱系-从-rle-到字典到-fsst\">编码谱系：从 RLE 到字典到 FSST</h2><p>存储层编码与执行层布局是两个层次：Parquet/ORC 负责把磁盘字节压到最小，Arrow/DuckDB 的 vector 负责让内存访问最快，二者通过解码器衔接。好的编码要同时满足压缩比高与可向量化解码。Parquet 格式规范（<code>https://github.com/apache/parquet-format</code>）定义的谱系是业界基准：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码</th>\n<th>适用类型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>PLAIN</code></td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>定长紧排 / 变长前缀长度</td>\n<td>无压缩收益、快速路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RLE</code> / bit-packed hybrid</td>\n<td>布尔、整型、级别</td>\n<td>游程 + 位打包混合，varint 头区分</td>\n<td>低基数列、稀疏与重复结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DELTA_BINARY_PACKED</code></td>\n<td>整型</td>\n<td>差分后分块位打包（块 128、miniblock 32）</td>\n<td>单调 id、时间戳、自增主键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DELTA_LENGTH_BYTE_ARRAY</code></td>\n<td><code>BYTE_ARRAY</code></td>\n<td>只对长度做差分，字节原样</td>\n<td>变长字段长度相近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DELTA_BYTE_ARRAY</code></td>\n<td><code>BYTE_ARRAY</code></td>\n<td>公共前缀增量编码</td>\n<td>有序字符串、URL、SKU 前缀族</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DICTIONARY</code></td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>字典页 + 整数下标</td>\n<td>低基数字符串（国家、币种、状态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BYTE_STREAM_SPLIT</code></td>\n<td>浮点</td>\n<td>按字节位面拆分重排</td>\n<td>浮点科学数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两条选择规则值得记住。<strong>低基数列先试字典编码</strong>：<code>country</code>（约 250 个取值）、<code>currency</code>（~180）、<code>logistics_status</code>（~20）用字典后，<code>VARCHAR</code> 被替换成 1 字节下标，配合 RLE 甚至只剩一位一个值。字典的失效方式可预期：累积超过字典页上限（Parquet 默认 1 MiB）就<strong>回退为 <code>PLAIN</code></strong>——「低基数」假设对订单号、收货地址并不成立。<strong>单调列用 DELTA</strong>：<code>order_id</code>、<code>created_at</code> 的相邻差分接近常数，位打包后每值只需几个位；Parquet 的 delta 编码按块（128 的倍数）与 miniblock（32 的倍数）两级组织，miniblock 内独立计算最小必要位宽，局部突变不会抬高整块位宽。</p>\n<p>浮点的 <code>BYTE_STREAM_SPLIT</code>（Parquet 2.8.0 引入）解决另一类问题：IEEE 754 的指数位高度相关、尾数位近似随机，按字节位面重排后指数与符号位面先形成高度重复的流，通用压缩器（Zstd/LZ4）就能大幅压缩而无需理解浮点语义。字符串则有专用压缩 <strong>FSST</strong>（Boncz, Neumann, Leis, VLDB 2020）：把 1–8 字节的高频子串映射成 255 个单字节符号加一个转义码，既得到 2–3 倍级别压缩，又<strong>保留随机访问</strong>——符号替换而非上下文相关的变长编码，解压单个字符串无需从流头重建状态（这正是它相对要求顺序解码整块的 LZ4/Zstd 的价值）。字典消除<strong>取值</strong>的重复，FSST 消除<strong>字节子串</strong>的重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编码感知的执行-常量-字典与延迟物化\">编码感知的执行：常量、字典与延迟物化</h2><p>如果编码只停留在存储层，引擎就只是「解码器 + 算子」。把编码变成执行期资产的做法是让编码<strong>穿透到算子边界</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>CONSTANT</code> 向量</strong>：整批 2048 行同一个值，物理上只存一个标量（<code>WHERE currency = &#39;EUR&#39;</code> 的常量、join 探测键、标量参数）。算子对 <code>CONSTANT</code> 输入可整批短路，无需展开。</li>\n<li><strong><code>DICTIONARY</code> 向量</strong>：值是「下标 + 字典」两段。对字典向量做 <code>=</code> 比较时先把常量在字典里查一次，再把结果退回成对下标的比较——2048 次字符串比较压成 1 次查找加 2048 次 <code>int8</code> 比较。DuckDB 的 <code>Vector</code> 类型枚举与 Velox 的 <code>DictionaryVector</code> 都是这个设计。</li>\n<li><strong><code>SEQUENCE</code>/<code>RLE</code> 向量</strong>：等差或游程形态，对 <code>order_id BETWEEN a AND b</code> 可直接按区间计算。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>共同前提是 <strong><code>sel</code>（选择向量）与编码正交</strong>：算子接收「编码 + 可选选择向量」，并尽量保持输入编码以维持零拷贝（见 <a href=\"../column-operators-simd/simd-selection-vector-model\">./1_simd-selection-vector-model.md</a> 的算子契约）。与之配套的是<strong>延迟物化（late materialization）</strong>：过滤阶段只处理谓词涉及的窄列并产出选择向量，排序或输出时才按 <code>sel</code> 从宽列（<code>sku</code>、<code>shipping_address</code>）逐行抓取。Abadi 等人（ICDE 2007）量化了这一取舍：选择向量越短、宽列越宽，延迟物化省的 I/O 与解压越多；但选择率接近 1 时随机回表反超顺序扫描，故优化器按<strong>估计选择率</strong>切换。这套布局与 <a href=\"../execution-model-evolution/push-vectorized-execution\">../1_execution-model-evolution/2_push-vectorized-execution.md</a> 的推送式批处理互相成全：推送模型传递的「批」，物理形态正是本节描述的缓冲区数组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>列存用「一列一段连续缓冲区」取代「一行一段记录」，扫描代价从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot W \\cdot b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot C \\cdot b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，收益约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W/C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（C-Store, VLDB 2005；MonetDB/X100, CIDR 2005）。</li>\n<li>Arrow 把列抽象成 validity + data（+ offsets）缓冲区数组，切片与父子数组共享内存，是零拷贝的基础（<code>https://arrow.apache.org/docs/format/Columnar.html</code>）。</li>\n<li>变长类型用 offsets + data 两段式；短字符串可用 16 字节 View 布局（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 字节内联）消除跳转。</li>\n<li>空值用 LSB-first validity bitmap 表示，开销 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>sizeof</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(8 \\cdot \\text{sizeof}(T))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>；位图必须与三值逻辑全程并行传递，<code>NOT</code> 与 <code>OR</code> 是最易错点。</li>\n<li>存储编码谱系：字典（低基数）、DELTA（单调）、RLE/bit-packed（重复与级别）、BYTE_STREAM_SPLIT（浮点位面）、FSST（字符串子串）；Parquet 字典溢出后回退 <code>PLAIN</code>。</li>\n<li>编码应穿透到执行期：<code>CONSTANT</code> / <code>DICTIONARY</code> 向量让批量比较退化为整型比较，配合 <code>sel</code> 实现延迟物化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"列式内存布局、编码与空值位图：向量化执行的物理基础","id":"列式内存布局-编码与空值位图-向量化执行的物理基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：列是缓冲区数组，而不是记录数组","id":"核心概念-列是缓冲区数组-而不是记录数组"},{"level":2,"text":"定长与变长：偏移量缓冲区与视图结构","id":"定长与变长-偏移量缓冲区与视图结构"},{"level":2,"text":"空值位图：三值逻辑的物理载体","id":"空值位图-三值逻辑的物理载体"},{"level":2,"text":"编码谱系：从 RLE 到字典到 FSST","id":"编码谱系-从-rle-到字典到-fsst"},{"level":2,"text":"编码感知的执行：常量、字典与延迟物化","id":"编码感知的执行-常量-字典与延迟物化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SIMD 算子调优、标量回退与正确性验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/column-operators-simd/simd-operator-tuning-fallback"},"next":{"title":"Morsel 驱动并行与物化边界（pipeline breaker）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/memory-pipeline-vector/morsel-pipeline-parallelism"}}